    "body": "See the discussion at https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/687#issuecomment-390124209. I'm not sure that's worth revisiting.\r\n\r\nI think it makes sense to enforce XFO for redirects. HTML doesn't do that currently, but that could be changed. I'm not entirely sure I understand the analysis in the Chromium bug. Is the assumption that all those redirects do not want to be blocked? Why?",
