    "body": "Enforcing CORP for navigations might break navigations that are expected to succeed.\r\n\r\nI had read the Chromium thread, and what I don't understand is why the conclusion is that blocking those fetches would be bad. It seems some more analysis would be needed to reach that conclusion.",
